    "title": "Mivo: Face swap video bride",
    "description": "Mivo is a <font color=\"\u201dblue\u201d\"><b>Free Face Swap Video Editor App</b></font> with music templates and AI photo effects. You can change the face in a video with your photos in one click and generate your AI portraits without going to a photo studio.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2728<b>Face swap video & photo</b>: \r\nWith Mivo AI Face Swap App, your face will be transferred from one picture to another.\r\nFace Swap Meme Maker: Make funny face swap videos & GIFs with just a selfie.\r\nThousands of templates updated with trends: Find the most popular short videos and reface them with your photos. \r\nPerfect AI artwork: AI tech applies the face features precisely, making every refaced video look real for your audience.\r\n\r\n\u2728<b>Thousands of AI Video Templates with Music</b>: \r\n<font color=\"\u201dblue\u201d\"><b>New Face Dance Templates</b></font>: Level up the fun with Face Dance! Imagine the magic of seeing your favorite portraits come alive, Mivo face dance animation player brings your face to life with funny expressions and movements. Experience the future of photo animation with Mivo and watch your selfies take on a life of their own.\r\n\r\nMivo Music Video Maker offers amounts of video templates with great effects and transitions. You can make creative videos on social media with photos using the latest trending songs.\r\nEdit videos automatically: Mivo Video Editor can merge photos, add music and animated texts to videos, and make\r\nslideshow automatically, all you need to do is upload a photo.\r\nPhoto to video: Choose a background music that fits your needs, upload your photos, the templates in Mivo Photo Slideshow Maker can turn static photos into videos or GIFs quickly.\r\n\r\n\u2728<b>Here's what you can do with Mivo</b>:\r\n<b>Generate photos with your favorites</b>: Can\u2018t meet the person you want to meet quickly? Mivo makes it easy to take photos with the person you want to see. Even if the person is far away, you only need to take your selfies together to get a precious photo for free.\r\n<b>Make your AI portraits</b>: Create your own unique AI photos and get countless likes on social media! You can also use the templates provided by Mivo to make your own photo videos to show your charm.\r\n<b>Play with face swap </b>: Generate your own memes with Mivo Meme Generator, share face swap photos with your friends. You can transform your face into an animal, movie star, singer, dancer, baby and more. Gender switch and hairstyle changes is possible.\r\n<b>Generate the most popular videos for free</b>: It only takes a few seconds for Mivo AI photo editor to work its magic. The process of making photos is free. Like a pro, you can customize the video export resolution, HD professional video editor (720P), you can also share your music video to all social apps, such as YouTube, Instagram, Facebook, Whatsapp, TikTok, etc.\r\n<b>Safe & Secure</b>:\r\nPlease note, we DO NOT record any of your facial or bio information. The selfie you take in Mivo is only used in the video-making process, which all takes place on your own device.",
